# ios stager EXCLUDE — the ios-RESOURCES.rows rows the BundleStager
# deliberately does NOT stage as files, keyed by accessor suffix (hand-owned;
# every row here is a staging decision, reviewable in diffs). Everything else
# in the store joins the generated BundleStager table automatically — that
# default-include is the point: a new embedded row stages without a stager
# edit, so the fs-durable.js strike-four class (a RESOURCES row whose staging
# write was forgotten) cannot recur. Rows land here only when their bytes
# reach the device another way; each group names that way. A suffix the store
# does not have is structural drift (gen-staging-emit --check fails loud).
# The scenario/web-live entries: their drive runtimes eval these accessors'
# bytes directly (CarrierRuntime, SessionRuntime, CameraPlaneDrive, ...), and
# the whole scenario/ + web-live/ dirs ride the spine TREES mirror
# (scenario=scenario, web-live=web-live) for the graphs that import them.
scenario_js
scenario_m2_js
scenario_device_plane_js
scenario_ble_plane_js
scenario_camera_plane_js
scenario_mic_plane_js
scenario_m2_session_js
scenario_carrier_js
scenario_m2_llm_js
scenario_m3_fetch_install_js
scenario_upstream_parity_js
scenario_upstream_suite_js
scenario_agent_flow_js
scenario_card_player_js
scenario_question_face_js
scenario_create_card_js
scenario_create_calendar_live_js
scenario_b1_web_live_js
scenario_b3_web_live_js
scenario_b4_web_live_js
scenario_session_persist_restart_web_live_js
scenario_manager_legs_probe_js
# The upstream/shims faces: the whole upstream/shims dir rides the spine
# TREES mirror (upstream/shims=upstream/shims) — no Swift consumer reads
# these accessors' C arrays.
shims_util_js
shims_util_types_js
shims_os_js
shims_process_js
shims_dsh_session_persistence_js
# The device-plane / ble / mcp / plugin-manager-tools system plugins: the
# first two ride the spine TREES whole-dir mirrors (system-plugins/
# dsh-device-plane, dsh-ble); the mcp + plugin-manager-tools accessors serve
# no iOS staging today (their drives live on the other hosts).
plugin_device_plane_manifest
plugin_device_plane_js
plugin_ble_manifest
plugin_ble_js
plugin_mcp_manifest
plugin_mcp_js
plugin_mcp_present_js
plugin_manager_tools_manifest
plugin_manager_tools_js
